                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Description\n- - - \n- API to confirm receving and reading the target post for current user. \n- User can only confirm once for same post, repeating confirming will cause failure. \n\n\nParams\n- - -\nParam | Values | R |Description\n--- | --- | --- | ---\npost_id | | * | The target post to read\n\nHeaders\n- - -\nHeader | Values | R |Description\n--- | --- | --- | ---\n\n\n\nInput\n- - - \n\nAttribute | Values | R |Description\n--- | --- | --- | ---"
        },
